WEBVTT

00:00:00.406 --> 00:00:05.284
In this video, you will see the Founder city badge: what it means, and where it shows.

00:00:05.284 --> 00:00:06.268
We start on the map.

00:00:07.229 --> 00:00:08.903
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.779 --> 00:00:14.329
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:16.085 --> 00:00:17.065
Then tap Allow.

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:25.108
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:25.108 --> 00:00:27.891
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:27.891 --> 00:00:32.454
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:32.454 --> 00:00:33.155
Tap it.

00:00:35.777 --> 00:00:37.736
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:39.535 --> 00:00:43.624
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:43.624 --> 00:00:45.506
Tap Mine, your personal page.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.188
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:51.068 --> 00:00:53.119
This is a contest dashboard.

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:57.816
At the top, under the contest's name, is a small label: Founder city.

00:00:57.816 --> 00:01:02.888
It marks a city that is one of the first to run home decorating contests on SoCal Lights.

00:01:03.721 --> 00:01:06.853
The label only says the city is one of the first.

00:01:06.853 --> 00:01:14.310
It never changes votes, judging, results, or the order homes are listed in, and every home is treated the same way.

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:17.963
It is not an endorsement, by the city or by SoCal Lights.

00:01:18.818 --> 00:01:23.596
You see the same label on the Contests page, beside each of the city's contests.

00:01:24.433 --> 00:01:26.353
Tap the contest's button to open it.

00:01:28.506 --> 00:01:33.044
On the contest page, the label is at the top, next to the contest's status.

00:01:33.888 --> 00:01:38.203
And in Past results, a finished contest keeps its label next to the winners.

00:01:40.075 --> 00:01:45.359
The label shows only while it is active, and only on that city's own contests.

00:01:45.359 --> 00:01:49.534
If your city would like to run a contest, you can start one from the Add page.

00:01:50.396 --> 00:01:52.294
That is the Founder city badge.

00:01:52.294 --> 00:01:54.095
It is a label, and nothing more.

00:01:55.494 --> 00:01:57.324
Next up: Contest passes.
